{"version":1,"content":"\n<p>xDistance 是專注精準與私隱的 GPS 路線追蹤 App，適合戶外導航、運動訓練及路線核對人士使用；它可離線運作，所有資料只存放於裝置。原價 US $0.99，現正<a href=\"https://www.newmobilelife.com/category/apps-%E6%83%85%E5%A0%B1/%E9%99%90%E6%99%82%E5%85%8D%E8%B2%BB%E6%83%85%E5%A0%B1/\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">限時免費</a>。</p>\n<figure><img alt=\"限時免費\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"460\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://www.newmobilelife.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/460x460Icon-Ap-SiOS01-75-235.webp\" width=\"460\"/></figure>\n<h2>離線記錄與偏差警示</h2>\n<p>xDistance 支援路線記錄與暫停續錄，能準確追蹤距離、路徑及移動情況；提供線狀與點狀模式，當偏離容許範圍時會即時發出觸感警示，並以智能過濾減少 GPS 誤差造成的誤報。App 可在背景持續追蹤，亦支援匯入匯出路線、生成 PDF 報告及 ZIP 壓縮檔。全程離線運作，無帳戶、無雲端、無追蹤，資料只留在裝置。</p>\n<figure><figure><img alt=\"App Screenshot\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"2560\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://www.newmobilelife.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/1242x2688bb-239-scaled.jpg\" width=\"1183\"/></figure><figure><img alt=\"App Screenshot\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"2560\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://www.newmobilelife.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/1242x2688bb-240-scaled.jpg\" width=\"1183\"/></figure><figure><img alt=\"App Screenshot\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"2560\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://www.newmobilelife.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/1242x2688bb-241-scaled.jpg\" width=\"1183\"/></figure><figure><img alt=\"App Screenshot\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"2560\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://www.newmobilelife.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/1242x2688bb-242-scaled.jpg\" width=\"1183\"/></figure></figure>\n<ul><li>應用名稱：xDistance</li><li>應用類別：Navigation</li><li>下載位置：<a href=\"https://apps.apple.com/app/xdistance/id6757131823?uo=4\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">App Store</a></li></ul>\n","scraped_at":"2026-11-23T05:30:22.815706+00:00","quality":{"score":1,"chars":307,"images":5,"source":"New MobileLife","fallback":"none","origin":"article-html","completeness":"extracted"},"published_at":"2026-11-23T05:03:33+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-11-23T09:17:30.597355+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-11-23T05:23:58.178314+00:00","content_hash":"b7a5d000de29bc7d0f6cbf233dbc4edcde479b17d6d303a31d0c173792723a41","evidence_status":"full","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}